        "slc_d5a51a7c95ddda051418e14a5598690f0cd652ca7f35dfb792df998661c994dc"
      ],
      "text": "The product exposes a CLI including `ocx init`, `start`, `stop`, `service`, `codex-shim install`, `health`, `ready`, `status`, `gui`, plus subcommands for providers, accounts, combos, and v2 surface controls."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f191ab9b9bf78fe94c2d944c012709b165babae3cd0b3163c6e102e2c9493375",
