          "url": "https://github.com/lidge-jun/opencodex/blob/9f7397ed1582d95c6c1fcf4ae9951213b3fa2d19/README.md#L321-L324"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_12b22e1f2b9602e0f7c45b840f81a6f2c41279d0741aa84c3ef33998665b9905"
      ],
      "text": "The proxy serves `GET /healthz` for liveness and an unauthenticated `GET /readyz` returning a sanitized JSON identity; ready returns 200 while pending/failed return 503 with Retry-After: 1."
    },
