      ],
      "text": "Models are targeted with a `provider/model` syntax (e.g. `codex -m \"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"`); omitting the prefix uses the default provider or name-pattern auto-matching, and inner slashes in provider model ids are aliased to `-`."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8e15bb6a783e8b1e534381dc9458c5e65d563b6c43a9634ee2555f091ffffdd4",
