      ],
      "text": "Integration with Codex works by writing Codex-native config and catalog files under CODEX_HOME (config.toml, opencodex.config.toml, opencodex-catalog.json, models_cache.json), so routed models appear in Codex's picker without patching Codex itself."
    },
