        "slc_f54fc4f0ab378635613c53afa387730cb69bf93f6c0562b7c799f1b3eccd2c85"
      ],
      "text": "The runtime tracks 36 categories of retained process state: 12 byte-accounted stores evicted under a default 256 MiB budget, 4 monitored buffers, 24 state-store registrations with 60s expiry sweeps, and LRU-capped memos; live bytes are inspectable via GET /api/system/memory with the admin token."
    },
