        "slc_66b1b28ac16fc014d20f07925f2ba643778f456fbcdca6dc8b9f9d4e71e8757f"
      ],
      "text": "The package requires Node 18+ and bundles the Bun runtime on npm install, so no separate Bun installation (or WSL on Windows) is needed; supported OSes are macOS, Linux, and Windows x64 with launchd, systemd user units, or Task Scheduler/WinSW respectively."
    },
